# Directory of the audio-analysis socket.
#
# Install as /etc/tmpfiles.d/jukebox-audio.conf, then create it once without
# rebooting:  sudo systemd-tmpfiles --create /etc/tmpfiles.d/jukebox-audio.conf
#
# /run is emptied at every boot; this line recreates the directory each time:
#
#   owner  jukebox         the Phoenix release creates the socket in it
#   group  jukebox-audio   the group Shairport Sync's user is added to, so the
#                          analyser it starts can reach the socket
#   mode   2750            owner: everything; group: enter and list; others:
#                          nothing. The leading 2 (setgid) makes the socket
#                          created inside belong to jukebox-audio as well.
#
# Type  Path          Mode  User     Group          Age
d       /run/jukebox  2750  jukebox  jukebox-audio  -
